		"description": "<p>At 11th level, your contingencies now have contingencies, and you’re ever ready to use your magic to defend your allies when it counts the most. When an ally within your threatened area fails a Strength or Dexterity saving throw, you can expend your reaction to allow them to reroll the check. You may use this ability once per short or long rest.</p>",
